  "body": "## Summary\n\nThis adds the specific first-cut observation `q_extra = B2 X_U` to the fixed QQ16 F0/B1 witness analysis. For each of the eight reviewed lost directions\n\n`h_k = (48 I - B1* B1) B2* e_k`,\n\nthe pinned Gram identities give `B1 h_k = 0` and identity coefficient `B2 h_k = 2112 e_k`. Thus this changed ordinary-to-selected observation separates that eight-dimensional witness family. It does not establish injectivity of a full controller.\n\nThe package also computes an exact, deliberately optimistic profile-only ceiling screen. Adding one ideal rank-8 output charge leaves a 0.043725878% ceiling improvement; eight rank-one output charges miss the selected ceiling by 0.035543596%. Even under the rank-8 envelope, only two further rank-one-equivalent charges fit. The query-row ADD count, native address/frame wrapper, output hosting, helper ownership, dirty-state restoration and recursive precision are not derived, so this is not a complete controller, supplier, or new \u03ba result.\n\n## Pins and attribution\n\n- Exact base: `7c1e7811c730b17fe0eeef6c82ef011318b0465e`.\n- Selected record SHA-256: `10b9e340fd8e354a37a0c4813c90e5de1dd42044b5f6aca4a3fc5a42b685fa32`.\n- Predecessor: merged PR #1969 at `a6e6ad3936f67b8f63b5b68c5e75d540610a65e7`, whose QQ16 words and reviewed witness are pinned as inputs. The source route enumeration and prior witness are relied upon, not independently replayed here.\n- The refreshed overlap scan at 2026-10-14 18:49 UTC covered all 350 open PRs and 729 Discussions with complete pagination and no warnings. Exact-term search found this claim (#2074) and this package only; nearby work is distinct.\n- Credit Ali Romman and the PR #1969 lineage for the existing QQ16 words and witness. Prepared by Cinna Davis with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance in selecting and deriving the added observation and calculating the conditional profile screen.\n\n## Reproduction and checks\n\nFrom the repository root:\n\n```sh\npython3 -I -B research/joint-query-extra-b2-observation-seed3e62/verify.py\npython3 scripts/research_package.py --package research/joint-query-extra-b2-observation-seed3e62 --check-only\nmake selected-record-check\n```\n\nObserved: `PASS_QQ16_EXTRA_B2_OBSERVATION_SCREEN`, `PASS_PACKAGE_METADATA_AND_PINS`, and `PASS selected record ... 836330098538459/500000000000000000`. The verifier ran with the installed Python 3.14 runtime. Python 3.12 is unavailable in this environment, so the generic Python 3.12 package replay was not run. The verifier checks the pinned eight-direction identities and exact profile brackets; it does not reconstruct the source routes, implement the extra query, or check a full controller.\n",
